 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "\"Shinde Miro\" to Iwareta no de Shinimashita."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "「死んでみろ」と言われたので死にました。"
   },
   {
    "en": "You Said \"Die\", so I Went Ahead and Did It"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Die, then.\" Those were her husband's final words to her—cold, cruel, and unforgivable.\n\nOnce a noble countess, Natalie Pedigrew was forced into a political marriage with a foreign aristocrat after war devastated her homeland. Abused by her mother-in-law, ridiculed by servants, and ultimately betrayed by her husband, Natalie chose death as her only escape. But fate had other plans.\n\nWhen she opens her eyes, she finds herself more than a decade in the past—before the war, before the arranged marriage, before her world crumbled. Given this miraculous second chance, Natalie swears she will never again walk the path of despair. She'll protect her family, take control of her own future, and do everything to avoid the destiny that once destroyed her.",
   "ja": "元伯爵令嬢ナタリー・ペディグリューは戦争の代償として他国の貴族に嫁ぎ、そこで姑や使用人から激しい嫌がらせを受けていた。最後には夫にまで「死んでみろ」と挑発され、怒りと失望の果てに自ら命を絶ってしまう。彼女が目を覚ますと、幸せだった十年以上前に時が戻っていた。病と戦争で両親を失い、国を救った漆黒の騎士ユリウスに嫁がされる…そんな人生はもう嫌！"
  },
